wardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>UNITED KINGDOM</span> <span>01/18/2023</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG-LOKI-850P-SFX-L-GAMING Media review Award of Extreme Aesthetics award!\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.overclock3d.net/reviews/power_supply/asus_rog_loki_850w_platinum_sfx-l_psu_review/1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1339/202102252235063120069.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Exceptional Aesthetics \" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      OC3D TV\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Exceptional Aesthetics </p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n       is on the premium side of the power supply spectrum, there is nothing truly negative that we have to say about the ROG Loki. This PSU is easily the best looking SFX PSU that we have ever tested, and its specifications leave nothing to be desired. You can create an incredibly powerful small form factor system with the ROG Loki 850W, and with its Cybenetics Lambda A certification, you can be sure that your PSU will be one of the quietest components in your system. \n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>UNITED KINGDOM</span> <span>01/18/2023</span></div> <a aria